    <config key="metadata">
        <entry key="description" type="xstring" value="Normalization of selected columns. It is possible to choose from several normalization methods (median, quantile, loessF). If you do not want to normalize data select &quot;no normalization&quot;.%%00010%%00010Data to be normalized can be also filtered prior the normalization step (similarly to what Binary matrix calculator node can do) to cover only selected rows fulfiling defined criteria (in how many replicates - number of percentage - of at least one sample group is the given feature present, e.g., quantified). Experimental design is needed for this step.%%00010%%00010If a dataset should be normalized in subsets, user can specify the subsets of columns that should be normalized (including the filtering step) together under Subsets design. Design should be provided in format &quot;A, A, B, B&quot; where A and B define columns to be normalized together. The order of categories is kept as per their occurence in the design field.%%00010%%00010=================%%00010%%00010Used programs and tools and their respective licenses at the time of the metanode creation. Version numbers and the licenses might differ based on your local installation. Please inspect your local installation and contact us if you can not locate your local version and or license terms.%%00010%%00010KNIME nodes (The KNIME nodes consists of the following GNU GPL 3.0 License. Licence terms are available here: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html)%%00010Python 3 (The Python consists of the following Python 3.6 License. Licence terms are available here: https://docs.python.org/3.6/license.html)%%00010Python package Pandas (The Pandas consists of the following BSD License. Licence terms are available here: https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause)%%00010R 3.6.3 (The R consists of the following GPL-3 License. License terms are available here: https://www.r-project.org/Licenses/GPL-3)%%00010%%00010The metanode was created in KNIME 4.7.7 running inside the docker image (https://hub.docker.com/r/cfprot/knime/), tag 4.7.7a.%%00010%%00010=================%%00010%%00010This version of metanode is available under the GNU GPL 3.0 License, unless stated otherwise. The full version of the license terms is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html.%%00010Version: 3.0.1 from 2026-06-12%%00010Contact person: Karolina Krystofova (karolina.krystofova@ceitec.muni.cz)"/>
